  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "title": "Create the JPA link entity and repository",
      "description": "Add a Link entity mapped with Spring Data JPA containing the original URL, unique seven-character code, and click count initialized to zero. Add repository methods for lookup by code and a concurrency-safe follow operation, using a transactional pessimistic lock or equivalent atomic update so concurrent follows each increment the count exactly once. Enforce code uniqueness at the database level.",
